{"prompt": {"messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a helpful assistant that translates Java code to Python 3 code. The code should reads and writes I/O from the console."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Translate the following Java 8 code to Python 3 code. The code reads and writes I/O from the console. Your translated code should have the exact same functionality as the given code, meaning that it should have the same output for any given input.\nPrint your translated code and also the confidence score you give to your translation. The confidence score should be a number between 0 and 1. The format of the output should be:\n<translated_code>\n<your_translated_code>\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n<your_confidence_score>\n</confidence>\nDo not provide any other text or markdown fences.\n\nHere is the original Java 8 code you have to translate:\n<original_code>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class cutlet {\n    static int n, k, lo, hi;\n    static int[][] segs;\n    static int[] l, delt;\n    static int[][][] dp;\n    static ArrayList<int[]> finSeg = new ArrayList<>();\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        FastScanner in = new FastScanner(System.in);\n        n = in.nextInt();\n        k = in.nextInt();\n        segs = new int[k][2];\n        for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) {\n            segs[i][0] = in.nextInt();\n            segs[i][1] = in.nextInt();\n        }\n        Arrays.sort(segs, (o1, o2) -> o1[0] - o2[0]);\n        for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) {\n            lo = segs[i][0];\n            hi = segs[i][0];\n            while (i < k && segs[i][0] <= hi) hi = Math.max(hi, segs[i++][1]);\n            finSeg.add(new int[]{lo, hi});\n            i--;\n        }\n        k = finSeg.size();\n        segs = new int[k][2];\n        l = new int[k];\n        delt = new int[k];\n        for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) segs[i] = finSeg.get(i);\n        for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) {\n            l[i] = segs[i][1] - segs[i][0];\n            delt[i] = i < k - 1 ? segs[i + 1][0] - segs[i][1] : 2 * n - segs[i][1];\n        }\n        dp = new int[2][k + 1][2 * n + 1];\n        for (int i = 0; i < 2 * n + 1; i++) {\n            dp[0][k][i] = n;\n            dp[1][k][i] = n;\n        }\n        dp[0][k][n] = 0;\n        dp[1][k][n] = 0;\n        // Inline RMQ using simple loop (functionally same, slower)\n        for (int i = k - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n            for (int j = 0; j <= 2 * n; j++) {\n                dp[0][i][j] = j + l[i] + delt[i] <= 2 * n ? dp[0][i + 1][j + l[i] + delt[i]] : n;\n                dp[1][i][j] = dp[1][i + 1][j];\n                // compute min over range [j, min(j+l[i],2n)] for rmq[1]\n                int min1 = Integer.MAX_VALUE;\n                int r1 = Math.min(j + l[i], 2 * n);\n                for (int t = j; t <= r1; t++) min1 = Math.min(min1, dp[1][i + 1][t]);\n                dp[0][i][j] = Math.min(dp[0][i][j], 1 + min1);\n                if (j + delt[i] <= 2 * n) {\n                    int r2 = Math.min(j + l[i] + delt[i], 2 * n);\n                    int min0 = Integer.MAX_VALUE;\n                    for (int t = j + delt[i]; t <= r2; t++) min0 = Math.min(min0, dp[0][i + 1][t]);\n                    dp[1][i][j] = Math.min(dp[1][i][j], 1 + min0);\n                    dp[0][i][j] = Math.min(dp[0][i][j], 2 + min0);\n                }\n                int min1b = Integer.MAX_VALUE;\n                int r1b = Math.min(j + l[i], 2 * n);\n                for (int t = j; t <= r1b; t++) min1b = Math.min(min1b, dp[1][i + 1][t]);\n                dp[1][i][j] = Math.min(dp[1][i][j], 2 + min1b);\n            }\n        }\n        int ans = dp[1][0][0];\n        if (ans == n) System.out.println(\"Hungry\");\n        else {\n            System.out.println(\"Full\");\n            System.out.println(ans);\n        }\n    }\n\n    private static class FastScanner {\n        private InputStream stream;\n        private byte[] buf = new byte[1024];\n        private int curChar;\n        private int numChars;\n\n        public FastScanner(InputStream stream) {\n            this.stream = stream;\n        }\n\n        int read() {\n            if (numChars == -1) throw new InputMismatchException();\n            if (curChar >= numChars) {\n                curChar = 0;\n                try {\n                    numChars = stream.read(buf);\n                } catch (IOException e) {\n                    throw new InputMismatchException();\n                }\n                if (numChars <= 0) return -1;\n            }\n            return buf[curChar++];\n        }\n\n        boolean isSpaceChar(int c) {\n            return c == ' ' || c == '\\n' || c == '\\r' || c == '\\t' || c == -1;\n        }\n\n        boolean isEndline(int c) {\n            return c == '\\n' || c == '\\r' || c == -1;\n        }\n\n        public int nextInt() {\n            return Integer.parseInt(next());\n        }\n\n        public long nextLong() {\n            return Long.parseLong(next());\n        }\n\n        public double nextDouble() {\n            return Double.parseDouble(next());\n        }\n\n        public String next() {\n            int c = read();\n            while (isSpaceChar(c)) c = read();\n            StringBuilder res = new StringBuilder();\n            do {\n                res.appendCodePoint(c);\n                c = read();\n            } while (!isSpaceChar(c));\n            return res.toString();\n        }\n\n        public String nextLine() {\n            int c = read();\n            while (isEndline(c)) c = read();\n            StringBuilder res = new StringBuilder();\n            do {\n                res.appendCodePoint(c);\n                c = read();\n            } while (!isEndline(c));\n            return res.toString();\n        }\n    }\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport sys\n\ndef solve():\n    data = sys.stdin.read().split()\n    if not data:\n        return\n    it = iter(data)\n    n = int(next(it))\n    k = int(next(it))\n    segs = []\n    for _ in range(k):\n        lo = int(next(it))\n        hi = int(next(it))\n        segs.append([lo, hi])\n    segs.sort(key=lambda x: x[0])\n    finSeg = []\n    i = 0\n    while i < k:\n        lo = segs[i][0]\n        hi = segs[i][1]\n        while i < k and segs[i][0] <= hi:\n            hi = max(hi, segs[i][1])\n            i += 1\n        finSeg.append([lo, hi])\n        # i is already advanced past the merged segment\n    k = len(finSeg)\n    segs = finSeg\n    l = [0] * k\n    delt = [0] * k\n    for i in range(k):\n        l[i] = segs[i][1] - segs[i][0]\n        if i < k - 1:\n            delt[i] = segs[i+1][0] - segs[i][1]\n        else:\n            delt[i] = 2 * n - segs[i][1]\n    # dp[0] and dp[1] as 2D lists: dp[state][i][j]\n    dp = [[ [n] * (2 * n + 1) for _ in range(k + 1) ] for _ in range(2)]\n    for j in range(2 * n + 1):\n        dp[0][k][j] = n\n        dp[1][k][j] = n\n    dp[0][k][n] = 0\n    dp[1][k][n] = 0\n    for i in range(k - 1, -1, -1):\n        for j in range(2 * n + 1):\n            # dp[0][i][j] = j + l[i] + delt[i] <= 2n ? dp[0][i+1][j+l[i]+delt[i]] : n\n            if j + l[i] + delt[i] <= 2 * n:\n                dp[0][i][j] = dp[0][i+1][j + l[i] + delt[i]]\n            else:\n                dp[0][i][j] = n\n            # dp[1][i][j] = dp[1][i+1][j]\n            dp[1][i][j] = dp[1][i+1][j]\n            # min over [j, min(j+l[i], 2n)] for dp[1][i+1]\n            r1 = min(j + l[i], 2 * n)\n            min1 = n\n            for t in range(j, r1 + 1):\n                if dp[1][i+1][t] < min1:\n                    min1 = dp[1][i+1][t]\n            dp[0][i][j] = min(dp[0][i][j], 1 + min1)\n            if j + delt[i] <= 2 * n:\n                r2 = min(j + l[i] + delt[i], 2 * n)\n                min0 = n\n                for t in range(j + delt[i], r2 + 1):\n                    if dp[0][i+1][t] < min0:\n                        min0 = dp[0][i+1][t]\n                dp[1][i][j] = min(dp[1][i][j], 1 + min0)\n                dp[0][i][j] = min(dp[0][i][j], 2 + min0)\n            # min over same range for dp[1][i+1] again (same as min1)\n            dp[1][i][j] = min(dp[1][i][j], 2 + min1)\n    ans = dp[1][0][0]\n    if ans == n:\n        print(\"Hungry\")\n    else:\n        print(\"Full\")\n        print(ans)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    solve()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-6.079655122448457e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0001991788885788992, -6.842378934379667e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.005254387855529785, -0.0005957497633062303, -0.6943041682243347, -0.4740902781486511, -3.933898824470816e-06, -0.0001501924270996824, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.2538710832595825, 0.0, -0.048589371144771576, -2.861018856492592e-06, -0.4740864038467407, -7.986990567587782e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.31344282627105713, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -0.00033539868309162557, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -3.576278118089249e-07, -5.483612312673358e-06, -9.536738616588991e-07, -0.0018500846344977617, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.0004316828562878072, -3.6954811548639555e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -2.1219027985353023e-05, -3.7788631743751466e-05, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -5.364274329622276e-05, 0.0, -7.748573807475623e-06, -0.003728345036506653, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -0.000205018965061754, -0.0002037079248111695, -0.00011514954530866817, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -0.008825462311506271, -0.04867430776357651, 0.0, -1.311301275563892e-06, -0.0002616301644593477, -1.0728830375228426e-06, 0.0, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.002715354785323143, -6.556489552167477e-06, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.0003812778159044683, 0.0, 0.0, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, 0.0, -4.76837044516